{"game": "arc-raiders", "language": "english", "appid": 1808500, "month": "2026-05", "window": 2, "start_date": 1778198400, "end_date": 1778889599, "month_true_total": 6257, "quota": 10, "returned": 10, "pulled_at": "2026-09-10 21:18:59 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "225615486", "author": {"steamid": "76561197960825366", "personaname": "PeeledPP", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/petaren/", "num_games_owned": 62, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 42926, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 39113, "last_played": 1784101436, "avatar": "aaeb75ede2e10b572d80f8902b0229848e061cd8"}, "language": "english", "review": "The cheating problem in this game is extremely rampant!  \n\nWhen I play in PvP lobbies, I run into blatant cheaters at least once a day. And a recent post on Reddit puts a number on things: 76% of solo PvP lobbies have confirmed cheaters in them. With duos and trios being even worse. \n\nEmbark needs to make the cheating their first and only priority at this moment. I don’t even care about new content until the cheating problem has been dramatically reduced.", "timestamp_created": 1778889400, "timestamp_updated": 1778889400, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 4, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.530085444450378418", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1761816609", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 29, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "225614960", "author": {"steamid": "76561198123255173", "personaname": "Karma", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198123255173/", "num_games_owned": 97, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 33926, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 26709, "last_played": 1786211370, "avatar": "2260384692b8d076422aa07f73b030482dc577bb"}, "language": "english", "review": "Was fun at the start. \r\n\r\nNow every single match in high aggression lobbies has a hacker. The anticheat is a joke, and cheat punishments mean 30 days bans, not even permanent. VAC'd accounts happily playing. Would not recommend to anyone looking for PvP.", "timestamp_created": 1778888894, "timestamp_updated": 1778888894, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.501299381256103516", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1761816609", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 29, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "225614565", "author": {"steamid": "76561199805008642", "personaname": "UnluckyAlpacca", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/1241ui3/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 10, "playtime_forever": 28848, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 2, "playtime_at_review": 25505, "last_played": 1787945510, "avatar": "67dbaa2d87a2b822aa74420f4013040613ba3c3c"}, "language": "english", "review": "iss aight", "timestamp_created": 1778888496, "timestamp_updated": 1778888496, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1761816609", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "225614416", "author": {"steamid": "76561198711611706", "personaname": "Zyns&Weedpens", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198711611706/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 39959, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 15199, "playtime_at_review": 2426, "last_played": 1789099953, "avatar": "9520ec7433225f11305e64b975ff5dd8ea24cec3"}, "language": "english", "review": "its a love hate relationship ur up and its amazing then u get slimed out and its sad times lmao i have 500 top side hours on ps5", "timestamp_created": 1778888357, "timestamp_updated": 1778888357, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.476190477609634399", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1761816609", "hardware": {"system_ram": "15475", "os": "Windows 11", "cpu_name": "AMD Ryzen 5 9600X 6-Core Processor             ", "adapter_description": "NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5070", "vram_size": 11943}, "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "225613986", "author": {"steamid": "76561199084428224", "personaname": "KA KA KA", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Vbictoor/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 80, "playtime_forever": 24051, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 105, "playtime_at_review": 21088, "deck_playtime_at_review": 67, "last_played": 1788719295, "avatar": "41f1645b750120faf4d168c324cba06623198b28"}, "language": "english", "review": "ArcRaiders is a really freaking cool game, the ideas, the Arcs, the story, the graphics and soo much more. But as every online game, those things become kinda of second importance, what really matters in an online game is that it is not broken, not laggy and not an experience that lasts a couple of hours because it becomes boring.\n\nI like this game, but as every game, it has its pros and cons.\nThe pros are that it is really really chaotic and unpredictable, that it has a good movement system(sometimes kinda broken), good weapons, good maps, really cool missions that get you across all the map and make you understand the lore and last but not least really cool graphics.\n\nWhile the cons are that, the anticheat is bad, the maps are full of broken spots, the Arcs are not balanced and the servers are a**. I definitely have skill issues and a bad connection, but so far I ve seen Rocketeers spot players from over 600 meters away, without being shot at, i ve seen people duping, glitching through map and cheating (which doesnt really make much of a difference to me, if you make an online game its impossible to not have cheaters) and last things, the servers are wayy too laggy, i ve seen not a single person from Europe not lagging because of the severs. The Arcs became wayy to many and wayy to strong, you either go kitted for the Arcs or for the players, its really hard to find a middle way, they spawn way too often as well, after 5 minutes they are back again.\n\nAs i said before having cheaters and exploits its okay, but here maybe there are too many exploits, people duping without consequences, people glitching and soo much more. There has been a massive ban, but STILL, people STILL use the stuff that they duped. The game was full of bugs, since the first day, and the devs always patched them, and i really appreciate that, lot of devs dont even platch their games, but regardless the patches the game is always full of new exploits. \n\n(i forgot, but maybe a little rework of the skill tree wouldnt be bad, you know, some abilities dont change anything)\n\nSooo what im saying is, im not tfue or ninja or idk what pro player, reduce the amount of arcs, or put a PVE only mod, since you cant fix all the bugs and exploits player keep using. \n\nworst matchmaking system i ve ever seen", "timestamp_created": 1778887932, "timestamp_updated": 1783103236, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 1, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1761816609", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 32, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "225613833", "author": {"steamid": "76561198754946496", "personaname": "IMPOSTER", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcomm